# EAS Build — exclude everything not needed for the mobile build

# Monorepo: exclude backend and infra entirely
../apps/backend
../apps/backend/**
../nginx
../prometheus
../docker-compose.yml
../.gitignore

# Agent/AI tooling symlinks that break EAS archiving
**/.agents
**/.agents/**
**/.claude
**/.claude/**
**/.gemini
**/.gemini/**
**/skills
**/.cursorrules

# Development artifacts
**/.expo
**/node_modules/.cache
**/*.log
**/*.map

# OS junk
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
